s=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. On that middle, January to February ran 23% of normal in 2025 and September to October ran 59% in 2025. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 19% on the middle of the grids. Grid 28636 had its driest year in 1976 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
